Well then, bye-bye! Let's say goodbye! Okay!

821
01:01:49,163 --> 01:01:53,663
Bye-bye!

822
01:02:18,200 --> 01:02:23,200
夢のぬくもりと
With the warmth of a dream,

823
01:02:23,520 --> 01:02:30,340
指先に絵の具の匂い
the scent of paint lingers on my fingertips.

824
01:02:31,240 --> 01:02:36,540
湿ったキャンバスの上には
Upon the damp canvas,

825
01:02:36,960 --> 01:02:43,300
まだ知らない色が息をする
colors yet unknown are beginning to breathe.

826
01:02:43,840 --> 01:02:46,920
All the pieces I picked up

827
01:02:47,060 --> 01:02:49,540
Unravel in my own chest

828
01:02:49,860 --> 01:02:55,540
"It's okay," i whisper softly, saying it back to myself.

829
01:02:56,360 --> 01:03:01,900
迷いも震えも 隠さなくていいから
Doubts and tremors don't need to be hidden away.

830
01:03:02,200 --> 01:03:08,480
この線の全部が 私へ続く
Every single one of these lines leads straight to me.

831
01:03:09,320 --> 01:03:12,320
I'm drawing out my true colors

832
01:03:12,600 --> 01:03:16,560
滲んだ輪郭も
Even the blurred outlines,

833
01:03:16,760 --> 01:03:21,700
淡く、脆く、煌めいて 形になってゆくの
faint, fragile, and shimmering, take shape.

834
01:03:22,160 --> 01:03:30,540
夜明けの面影に 集めた色を重ね
Layering the colors gathered in the shadow of dawn—

835
01:03:31,300 --> 01:03:34,660
Draw it slow, draw it true

836
01:03:47,820 --> 01:03:53,440
夜明けの夢現
In the waking dream of dawn,

837
01:03:53,540 --> 01:03:59,340
微睡に余白の答え
a slumbering answer in the whitespace.

838
01:04:00,240 --> 01:04:06,480
白いページに色が咲いていく
Colors bloom across the white pages,

839
01:04:06,860 --> 01:04:12,800
息づいた景色を描き出す
painting a breathing landscape.

840
01:04:13,400 --> 01:04:16,640
All the colors I held back

841
01:04:16,873 --> 01:04:19,540
Start to gather in the hush

842
01:04:19,820 --> 01:04:25,700
"It's all right," the first light tells me, sending warmth into my heart

843
01:04:26,200 --> 01:04:32,033
願いも希望も 隠さなくていいんだよ
My wishes and hopes don't need to be hidden away either.

844
01:04:32,433 --> 01:04:38,673
ほら、ありのままの 私を描く
Look, I am drawing myself just as I am.

845
01:05:07,593 --> 01:05:10,693
At last, hold my true colors

846
01:05:11,253 --> 01:05:14,113
ほどけた輪郭も
Even the untied outlines,

847
01:05:14,773 --> 01:05:19,753
そっと、ずっと、重なって 私の形になる
softly and forever overlapping into my shape,

848
01:05:20,713 --> 01:05:23,773
静かな始まりに
at the quiet beginning,

849
01:05:24,233 --> 01:05:29,333
目覚めた色を抱いて
holding the awakened colors.

850
01:05:33,273 --> 01:05:36,453
I'm drawing out my true colors

851
01:05:36,813 --> 01:05:39,653
滲んだ輪郭も
even the blurred outlines,

852
01:05:40,253 --> 01:05:45,953
淡く、脆く、煌めいて 形になってゆくの
faintly, fragile, and gleaming into shape,

853
01:05:46,653 --> 01:05:53,973
夜明けの面影を集めた色で描く
painting with the colors gathered from dawn's lingering traces.

854
01:05:55,353 --> 01:05:58,573
Draw it slow, draw it true

855
01:06:06,271 --> 01:06:12,371
la, la, la, la, la, la, la

856
01:06:20,693 --> 01:06:23,893
Draw it slow, draw it true

857
01:06:27,973 --> 01:06:33,213
夢のぬくもりと
With the warmth of a dream,

858
01:06:33,893 --> 01:06:39,653
指先に絵の具の匂い
and the scent of paint on my fingertips,

859
01:06:40,873 --> 01:06:45,373
ありふれた朝の先には
beyond the ordinary morning,

860
01:06:46,013 --> 01:06:51,753
まだ知らない色が溢れてる
colors I don't yet know are overflowing.

861
01:07:15,971 --> 01:07:18,671
Ciao, everyone! I'm still here.

862
01:07:21,371 --> 01:07:28,371
