863
01:07:28,471 --> 01:07:32,871
I had so much fun and I hope you had so much fun too!

864
01:07:33,171 --> 01:07:39,371
I worked really, really hard and I'm so happy right now, so thank you chadene, thank you everyone for watching!

865
01:07:39,871 --> 01:07:42,671
